  m_text: 'He gets confused, forgets where things are, and sometimes suspects the
    people closest to him.


    Today, you are his caregiver.


    Find what he
    needs. Choose your words carefully. How you respond matters more than you think.


    Keep
    him calm. Keep him safe. Be patient.'
